voacapl (J. A. Watson)
----------------------

The port was validated against voacapl, J. A. Watson's gfortran port of
VOACAP:

    https://github.com/jawatson/voacapl

J. A. Watson's modifications to the original VOACAP source are released
under the Creative Commons CC0 licence. The oracle outputs in golden/ were
produced by running voacapl (see the META.txt files there for the build and
inputs).

voacapl also contains GPL-licensed utilities (dst2csv, dst2ascii). None of
those files are included in the current tree.


CCIR/URSI coefficient data
--------------------------

The ionospheric coefficient files in src/voacap_gpu/data/coeffs/
(coeff01.asc to coeff12.asc, fof2CCIR.asc and fof2URSI.asc) come from the
VOACAP/ITSHFBC distribution, as shipped in voacapl's itshfbc/coeffs/
directory. The binary files in golden/coeffs/ were generated from voacapl's
ASCII coefficient sources with its coeffbin and fof2bin converters.

Older commits of this repository (before 477dad7) also contain a vendored
copy of voacapl and ITSHFBC under reference/, with voacapl's own COPYING and
LICENSE files. That tree is not part of the current tree.
